<title>MEXICO: Gruma 1997 Q1 net profit dwindles.</title>
<headline>Gruma 1997 Q1 net profit dwindles.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Q1 1997			Q1 1996</p>
<p>	Shr		  n.a.		     n.a.</p>
<p>	Oper Income	190.55 million	     208.83 million</p>
<p>	Net		  91.55 million		342.48 million</p>
<p>	Revs		 2.514 bln		2.764 bln</p>
<p>	Integ fin gain   12.97 million	gain  218.79 million</p>
<p>	  NOTE: All figures in Mexican pesos.</p>
<p>		Full company name is Gruma SA de CV.</p>
<p>((--Dan Trotta, Mexico City newsroom, +525 728-9507))</p>
